This plugin uses Handsontable 6.2.2. It is the last release under the MIT
license. Later releases use a license that does not allow commercial use, so
do not update to them.

The files in lib/ are copied unchanged from the npm package handsontable@6.2.2:

  dist/handsontable.min.js  ->  lib/handsontable.min.js
  dist/handsontable.css     ->  lib/handsontable.less

Do not change these files. Adjust the library's behavior in the plugin's own
scripts and styles instead.
